# GitHub Pages needs a public repo on the free plan, so everything committed
# here is on the open internet. The entries below are internal working files
# and full-size originals behind the resized copies the pages actually serve.
# Nothing listed here is referenced by any page. They stay on disk locally.

# Slide decks and other working documents
*.pptx

# Full-size sources for the resized copies under gallery/, pub/ and research/
images/figure/

# Pre-downscale portraits; team.html serves the 400x400 copies one level up
images/selected/_originals/

# Gallery originals and phone exports kept loose at the images/ root.
# The six files re-included below are the ones pages actually load --
# banner.jpg among them, reached from a CSS url() rather than an <img>.
images/*.jpg
images/*.png
!images/ai4ad.png
!images/ai4bms.png
!images/ai4mobility.png
!images/ai4sensing.png
!images/banner.jpg
!images/logo-full.png
!images/logo-full-dark.png

